2. Additional merged work (2026-10-19 architecture merge)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The shipped binary additionally contains a merge of:
  - streaming KV: page fault-back-in and budget-based demotion, wired into the
    KVMem ring;
  - the Bonsai 27B ternary model line (qwen3_5 execution path).
Source build root recorded in the binary: a local `infer-build/fusion-arch-20261019`
tree. This part is not a separate public repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. What this repository adds
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are original work in this repository and are NOT from upstream:

  - AGENTS.md                     measured deployment / tuning manual
  - tools/batcfg.py               launcher parsing (ports, model, args)
  - tools/autoconfig.py           per-GPU capacity calibration
  - tools/probe-*.py              capacity / dtype / VRAM / prefix-reuse probes
  - tools/analyze-requests.py     request-log analysis
  - tools/engine-session-log.py   engine start/stop session logs (keep last 3)
  - tools/ninfer-tray.py          Windows tray host
  - tools/warmup_proxy.py         local request-cleaning proxy (port 8094)
  - tools/eval/                   25-case quality evaluation set
  - tools/pack.py                 distribution packer (excludes models)
  - docs/                         model notes and community docs
  - start-*.bat / start-*.vbs     launchers

These are licensed Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).

